    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32621" root="غور" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغِيرٌ</span></b>  A horse <i>swift in running:</i> [see also what
next precedes:] and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِغْوَارٌ</span></b>  [likewise] signifies a
<i>swift</i> horse: or this latter, accord. to Lh, <i>vehement in running:</i> and its pl. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغَاوِيرُ</span>. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَيْلُ مُغِيرَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِغِيرَةٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَارَةٌ</span>.

